# Read against yashksaini-coder/dev-publish at 8b425261242ccb818738c6c8de71c7577b38ab61
# (confirmed HEAD on 2026-10-09 and 2026-10-19 via `gh api repos/.../contents/...`; still
# HEAD on 2026-10-22, when this diff was regenerated on a throwaway clone). Nothing was
# modified or pushed upstream. To use it: copy src/llm.ts, src/llm.test.ts,
# src/memory.ts and src/memory.test.ts in beside the existing modules, then
# `git apply seam.patch`.
#
# Generated by `git diff` at that sha (pnpm-lock.yaml left out on purpose) and verified
# with `git apply --check`, so the hunk offsets are real rather than hand-counted. With
# the four files copied in: `tsc --noEmit` clean, `vitest run` 67 passed across 7 files.
#
# package.json is in the diff on purpose: src/memory.ts does `await import(
# "@cognee/cognee-ts")`, and `tsc` resolves that import even though it is lazy, so
# without the dependency `pnpm typecheck` fails with TS2307. Installing it costs
# ~372 MB of node_modules; the step itself stays off until a key is set (or
# LLM_PROVIDER=ollama), and a config llm.ts rejects turns it off with one warning.
#
# NOT TESTED. src/llm.test.ts and src/memory.test.ts cover those two modules only.
# dev-publish has no index.test.ts (vitest covers config/frontmatter/images/devto/state)
# and its CI runs neither `pnpm test` nor `pnpm typecheck`, so these ~13 lines in main()
# are verified by nothing but a real publish run against a real dev.to key. A green
# test suite says nothing about this diff.

